# Option A — Single-host Docker Compose (production-ready) — Added files & instructions

Main aapke canvas scaffold ko Option A ke liye expand kar raha hoon: yeh section aapki repository mein add/replace karne ke liye full production files aur deploy scripts deta hai. Sab Hindi mein aur copy-paste ready.

## 1) `docker-compose.yml` (production)

```yaml
version: '3.8'
services:
  backend:
    build:
      context: .
      dockerfile: backend/Dockerfile
    container_name: shiksha_backend
    restart: unless-stopped
    volumes:
      - ./backend/shiksha.db:/app/shiksha.db
      - ./backend/logs:/app/logs
    environment:
      - PORT=8000
      - DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///app/shiksha.db
      - SECRET_KEY=change-me
    networks:
      - shiksha_net

  frontend:
    build:
      context: .
      dockerfile: frontend/Dockerfile
    container_name: shiksha_frontend
    restart: unless-stopped
    networks:
      - shiksha_net
    depends_on:
      - backend

  nginx:
    image: nginx:stable-alpine
    container_name: shiksha_nginx
    restart: unless-stopped
    ports:
      - "80:80"
      - "443:443"
    volumes:
      - ./infra/nginx/prod.conf:/etc/nginx/conf.d/default.conf:ro
      - /etc/letsencrypt:/etc/letsencrypt:ro
      - ./infra/nginx/html:/usr/share/nginx/html:ro
    depends_on:
      - frontend
      - backend
    networks:
      - shiksha_net

networks:
  shiksha_net:
    driver: bridge
```

> नोट: `/etc/letsencrypt` को host machine से माउंट कर रहे हैं — ये certbot से बनाए गए certs रखेगा।

